  "summary": "Gambling Goblin is a Chinese-speaking cybercrime cluster, tied to Earth Berberoka, that compromises Brazilian .gov.br web servers and installs custom Apache modules (opsproxy.c and a second RC4-configured filter module) which reverse-proxy selected paths to gambling and fake app-store pages while stripping CSP headers to hijack search traffic. The Linux toolkit includes the DownPro downloader, the setuid ChUser backdoor, the 3snake-based PasswordHarvester, the modular AlphaAgent backdoor with gRPC/DNS channels, oRAT, an SSH brute-forcer and Chinese-commented recon scripts, all masqueraded as kernel threads or legitimate system services.",
